WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.859
Checkpoint 1 focuses on recognition Classify each
variable

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:11.777
as nominal ordinal interval or ratio For numeric
variables

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.789
also decide whether the concept is counted or
measured Try to answer before

00:00:17.802 --> 00:00:23.345
opening the sample classifications If you are unsure
return to

00:00:23.358 --> 00:00:28.727
the questions label or quantity ordered or unordered
true zero or not counted or measured
